s Works\" width=\"240\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:240px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto;\"></a>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Iowan Old Style','Palatino Linotype',Palatino,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;color:#1c2430;margin:14px 0 4px;\">Posthumous Works</div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 8px;\">Allan Kardec</div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 10px;\">The first English edition of these selected writings, presented by the USSF to honor Kardec.</div>\n    <a href=\"https://sgny.org/catalog/books/allan-kardec/posthumous-works/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#c08a2d;text-decoration:none;\">Get the book &rarr;</a>\n  </td><td class=\"col\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 8px;\">\n    <a href=\"https://sgny.org/catalog/books/jussara-korngold/the-prism-of-grief/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/b68e90a1f6237b2836846604b/images/4d7f0720-da65-01b1-7b4c-2fb1db2de04e.jpeg\" alt=\"The Prism of Grief\" width=\"240\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:240px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:10px;margin:0 auto;\"></a>\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Iowan Old Style','Palatino Linotype',Palatino,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;color:#1c2430;margin:14px 0 4px;\">The Prism of Grief</div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 8px;\">Jussara Pretti Korngold</div>\n    <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 10px;\">Love, loss and awakening across the seasons of life: a healing path through sorrow.</div>\n    <a href=\"https://sgny.org/catalog/books/jussara-korngold/the-prism-of-grief/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#c08a2d;text-decoration:none;\">Get the book &rarr;</a>\n  </td></tr></table></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"background:#fbfaf7;padding:36px 40px;\"><div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c08a2d;text-align:left;margin:0 0 8px;\">Read · Learn · Listen</div><div style=\"font-family:'Iowan Old Style','Palatino Linotype',Palatino,Georgia,serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;color:#1c2430;text-align:left;margin:0 0 10px;\">More from our community</div><div style=\"height:12px;line-height:12px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e7e2d8;border-radius:14px;border-collapse:separate;overflow:hidden;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:0;\"><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/b68e90a1f6237b2836846604b/images/5914b842-cb3a-7c39-bd3e-ad2caf1ee28f.jpg\" alt=\"Law of Adoration: Drawing Closer to God\" width=\"518\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:518px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:0px;margin:0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"padding:22px 24px 20px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c08a2d;text-align:left;margin:0 0 8px;\">Revue Spirite · Issue 25</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Iowan Old Style','Palatino Linotype',Palatino,Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;color:#1c2430;margin:0 0 8px;\">Law of Adoration: Drawing Closer to God</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;\">Worship, the elevation of thought and moral progress, in the light of Spiritism, science, philosophy and ethics.</div>\n      <a href=\"https://revuespirite.cei-spiritistcouncil.com/revue-spirite-n25-year-169/?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#ffffff;color:#1f4e79;border:1px solid #e7e2d8;display:inline-block;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin:4px 8px 4px 0;\">Read the issue</a>\n    </div></td></tr></table><div style=\"height:20px;line-height:20px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e7e2d8;border-radius:14px;border-collapse:separate;overflow:hidden;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:0;\"><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/b68e90a1f6237b2836846604b/images/0d8832e1-c859-7ed9-4504-ad07aa96538e.jpeg\" alt=\"One new platform, two great courses\" width=\"518\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:518px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:0px;margin:0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"padding:22px 24px 20px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c08a2d;text-align:left;margin:0 0 8px;\">Virtual courses</div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Iowan Old Style','Palatino Linotype',Palatino,Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;color:#1c2430;margin:0 0 8px;\">One new platform, two gre