-my-hope/id6462927703\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#ffffff;color:#1f4e79;border:1px solid #e7e2d8;display:inline-block;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin:4px 8px 4px 0;\">App Store</a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.goodbarber.bemyhope\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background:#ffffff;color:#1f4e79;border:1px solid #e7e2d8;display:inline-block;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin:4px 8px 4px 0;\">Google Play</a>\n    </div></td></tr></table><div style=\"height:20px;line-height:20px;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:36px 40px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c08a2d;text-align:left;margin:0 0 8px;\">Watch &amp; learn</div>\n  <div style=\"font-family:'Iowan Old Style','Palatino Linotype',Palatino,Georgia,serif;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;color:#1c2430;text-align:left;margin:0 0 10px;\">Latest videos</div>\n  <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a5568;margin:0 0 12px;\">Catch up on this week's study groups:</div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0 18px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td width=\"46\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #e7e2d8;\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-eQSiZYKTNc\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;width:34px;height:34px;line-h